{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d01a89d9e11a63ff01ca2d78fdbe367e9c635b17f385bc031b128de6db15c9ec",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a763f49c3848a8561a26b9e20843f22ed692a93d5e4991df40250d721f11b2a",
      "text": "眼泪是努力的证明",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ecbc52a2acb85c437bc0686653cdce7d36f1be923f827dc09b624287c8cab4",
      "text": "志狼被学校留了很难的作业。\n虽然一开始抗拒着不想写，\n但在制作人“能解出这道题的话很帅气哦”的\n鼓励下开始动笔，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a763f49c3848a8561a26b9e20843f22ed692a93d5e4991df40250d721f11b2a",
      "text": "眼泪是努力的证明",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931f01603fc700267c0d43a190c516e2208bd5b5f7cd98e397fd4a7735a17054",
      "text": "辛苦啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5db0283c47c014161da8b6e95171e74a90e125cf3bdfed3e8447cb81aba1a8d1",
      "text": "……咦？志狼君，你怎么来了。\n今天应该没有工作安排吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9edc06b274868dfd207fe8aec1c8c924a39958a67e3899f4b40e448632ad3983",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n没啦……就是有点事！啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813e0f6dee933e225eafba71a9a8a23449ade95368033b0baeec14d17c9539c7",
      "text": "（总觉得样子有点奇怪啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102611e66ae53427f291663d52be6a42d20935e0b2feb26c30e6e1cd2e5f9967",
      "text": "难道是发生什么事了吗？\n不嫌弃的话，可以跟我讲讲哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f38c0f5875bfd72874e333cd4793e5e844afafb5ebcdb39d567b5ac6833325f",
      "text": "……唔。果然瞒不过\n●●●●プロデューサー啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab08231cdc64ca53e34e4de46564b5d26caa3c28f35e93a3308eda283df21f5a",
      "text": "那个啊，学校留了超难的作业。\n算术的……叫什么来着。应用题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1558b4c5487b05e2866703237fe9a11989813ab39b5b98910407b0f4ec1995aa",
      "text": "老师虽然说什么上课认真听了就一定能解出来～，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed572870ec9a13eae4d6e619d5a3aec78331919bf062ad8dffd6a98458d1295b",
      "text": "我上课又没认真听也根本不记得，\n绝对不可能写得出来啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f22cbac884064a978fdc4d5cd0a020359097b638a78ce10c6489e45ccfe9afa",
      "text": "所以，在被老妈问作业写了没？\n之前我就逃出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
